<div class="p-8">
  <h1 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800">관리자 로그인</h1>
  <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-gray-500">결제내역과 AI 에이전트를 관리하려면 로그인하세요.</p>

  <% if (usingDefaultPw) { %>
    <div class="mt-4 rounded-lg border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 p-3 text-xs leading-relaxed text-amber-700">
      <code>ADMIN_PASSWORD</code>가 설정되지 않아 임시 비밀번호 <code>admin</code>이 사용 중입니다. 배포 전 반드시 <code>.env</code>에 <code>ADMIN_PASSWORD</code>를 지정하세요.
    </div>
  <% } %>

  <% if (error) { %>
    <div class="mt-4 rounded-lg border border-red-200 bg-red-50 p-3 text-sm text-red-600"><%= error %></div>
  <% } %>

  <form method="post" action="/admin/login" class="mt-5 max-w-sm space-y-3">
    <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>" />
    <input type="password" name="password" placeholder="비밀번호" autofocus
      class="w-full rounded-lg border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-indigo-500 focus:outline-none" />
    <button type="submit" class="w-full rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-indigo-700">로그인</button>
  </form>
</div>
